| PWA | `vite-plugin-pwa` + service worker | Installable app shell, offline cached reports | না |
| Backend | Python + FastAPI | Pipeline orchestration, validation, scoring | না |
| ORM/Database | SQLAlchemy or SQLModel + SQLite | Analyses, evidence, API usage/history | না |
| OCR | EasyOCR | Screenshot থেকে Bangla/English text | না; local model |
| AI extraction/comparison | Gemini Developer API: `gemini-3.8-flash` primary, `gemini-3.5-flash-lite` fallback | Structured extraction ও bounded evidence comparison | হ্যাঁ |
