## Module 7. Exact API call sequence

```text
1. Browser -> FastAPI
   POST /api/v1/analyses
   multipart file=screenshot.png

2. FastAPI -> EasyOCR (local function call)
   image -> OCR text + confidence

3. FastAPI -> Gemini generate-content API [if enabled/available]
   OCR text + extraction JSON schema -> structured claim data

4. FastAPI -> local dataset index
   normalized claim/entities -> similar known records

5. FastAPI -> Tavily Search API [if enabled/available]
   focused query list -> URLs + snippets/content metadata

6. FastAPI -> Gemini generate-content API [if enabled/available]
   claim + retrieved evidence -> per-item stance JSON

7. FastAPI -> Python fusion engine
   validated comparisons + source metadata -> final report

8. FastAPI -> SQLite
   save analysis + evidence + provider events

9. Browser -> FastAPI
   GET /api/v1/analyses/{analysis_id}
   -> dashboard-ready JSON
```

One analysis may use two Gemini calls: one for extraction and one for evidence comparison. Tavily may receive multiple queries, so deduplication, query limit এবং per-analysis usage cap রাখতে হবে।

