## Module 14. Testing and evaluation checklist

- OCR test: clear/blurred, Bangla/English mixed, different fonts;
- extraction test: missing source/date, multiple claims, malformed OCR;
- prompt test: evidence page-এর prompt-injection-like text ignore হয় কি না;
- retrieval test: official domain appears, duplicate URLs removed;
- comparison test: every conclusion valid `evidence_id` cite করে;
- fusion unit test: support, contradiction, conflict, insufficient cases;
- quota test: Gemini/Tavily `429`, timeout এবং invalid key;
- upload security test: wrong extension, oversized/corrupt file, path-like filename;
- privacy test: delete action image ও related records clean করে;
- PWA test: installability, manifest/icons, standalone launch, service-worker update;
- offline test: new verification blocked honestly; cached reports remain readable;
- mobile test: camera/gallery/paste, safe area, tap targets, Bangla text wrapping;
- four-layer test: media/claim/context/source independently show unknown state when evidence is missing;
- dataset evaluation: held-out samples দিয়ে precision/recall/confusion matrix;
- human review: explanation ও links দেখে reviewer decision reproduce করতে পারে কি না।

